  "abstract_summary": "Long-term memory for LLM agents, as implemented in systems such as MemGPT and Mem0, is optimized for retrieval and scaling but lacks a systematic mechanism for preventing the accumulation of contradictory statements at write time. We formulate the admission problem as separate from storage and retrieval and propose...",
